  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《2025百字寫台文tio̍h獎作品 - 高中組》</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj6dAy7sLz9DgvWBo-Si_5TMEf4PaE9Po61vWoIjGi0TjbDNk80oGT0rZhfnKfxUcrzwUoSc6O-BY-m2qJ4ChHPqh8A95ffhKoF09r-tbZY_2oTi3zx_7HMI2fDJKAghVuZrrcu3cCkkNLcjcVT5Z5V__r6w3Bk7bk46HATC5PEb11PVJzAtjNMofZOJfwY\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj6dAy7sLz9DgvWBo-Si_5TMEf4PaE9Po61vWoIjGi0TjbDNk80oGT0rZhfnKfxUcrzwUoSc6O-BY-m2qJ4ChHPqh8A95ffhKoF09r-tbZY_2oTi3zx_7HMI2fDJKAghVuZrrcu3cCkkNLcjcVT5Z5V__r6w3Bk7bk46HATC5PEb11PVJzAtjNMofZOJfwY=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi0pI5OgRMSWy8DXpctzML5-zsjgYdywPhe4wYyMff1Q2T8yC8zUfAOcU5PQaPvyR20erl6sqIzhUp-fG45ztolCeKqYvBeIBsllXRUkj0V4fbUJeRWe_IFgjygrgAloXvaDmewoIJfRy3kW-YigIiCPDAzPnPYE7iclrAG7ZRecVuREGHBI4j6fXcrHCVq\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi0pI5OgRMSWy8DXpctzML5-zsjgYdywPhe4wYyMff1Q2T8yC8zUfAOcU5PQaPvyR20erl6sqIzhUp-fG45ztolCeKqYvBeIBsllXRUkj0V4fbUJeRWe_IFgjygrgAloXvaDmewoIJfRy3kW-YigIiCPDAzPnPYE7iclrAG7ZRecVuREGHBI4j6fXcrHCVq=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgkXAIDSVrzKWK9-Qa0_wH4oTBybm_UH7jUKaMCD-DvuzT9Zi6QB6_gm7ui64Aq_NmzMxQWq-zDii9t9HMUr18a0uYeixvaDzvCqyTiTcBkdqiMO0PVvMHorarJzwMsLQLQ4tWtSe0eIf6-bLvF1K3uR0sI2pP7RlqboCiC0oCb0CiZ3dQ_X3TVPdM3NFdn\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgkXAIDSVrzKWK9-Qa0_wH4oTBybm_UH7jUKaMCD-DvuzT9Zi6QB6_gm7ui64Aq_NmzMxQWq-zDii9t9HMUr18a0uYeixvaDzvCqyTiTcBkdqiMO0PVvMHorarJzwMsLQLQ4tWtSe0eIf6-bLvF1K3uR0sI2pP7RlqboCiC0oCb0CiZ3dQ_X3TVPdM3NFdn=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhRWVGe2ixn0bFw5lit0SBszmndZEzCAPgqcZlaC4QpknfNudgIond2o4yTFIIeCZ7KC6fNIgygatAi30VAwXAGZzKA18vL6jOcDGxZEkqlg0m5deReNDcjTAG2PlXg8Z5gkHqGx6gjlSoZ4k9OpMhC0dRUwPxuIWrcJOKH5KBVgx94lrgB88Tc2VNGU0eU\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"6071\" data-original-width=\"4299\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhRWVGe2ixn0bFw5lit0SBszmndZEzCAPgqcZlaC4QpknfNudgIond2o4yTFIIeCZ7KC6fNIgygatAi30VAwXAGZzKA18vL6jOcDGxZEkqlg0m5deReNDcjTAG2PlXg8Z5gkHqGx6gjlSoZ4k9OpMhC0dRUwPxuIWrcJOKH5KBVgx94lrgB88Tc2VNGU0eU=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><br /></span></div><div><span><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>吳孟芯Ngô͘ Bēng-sim</b></span>（國立台南護理專科學校）/ 優等</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div><b>Giám硬ê白磚仔</b></div><div><b><br /></b></div></span></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">白kah參雪saⁿ親像，幼kah像拄puh--出-來ê íⁿ。四角四角，白白落鼎，m̄管beh煎、beh chìⁿ、beh滷，總--是ài經過大pha火凌遲，chiah有好氣味。Chit塊豆腐，是豆仔hām水堅持ê溫柔。台灣chit粒番薯、chit隻海翁，tī滾chhiâng-chhiâng ê太平洋內底，tng-leh烘、tng-leh炒。M̄是總舖師工夫好、hòⁿ料理，是chô料koh hiam koh鹹硬beh chhi̍h，鹹酸苦澀沓沓仔浸、恬恬仔tīm。總--是ài刀仔liô--過、煎匙péng--過，氣味chiah ē siâⁿ--人。人客，lán tit-beh出菜--lo͘h！是苦？是甜？食--一-喙chiah知滋味。</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><div><div style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我是孟芯，chit-má是beh升專二ê高中生。感謝評審ê肯定，hō͘我有chit个發表ê機會。Chit篇作品tī chiâⁿ短ê時間內完成，因為靈感chiok飽、chiok tīⁿ。</div><div style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">未來，我ē繼續用生活來寫台語，用台語來寫生活。我是台灣人，我喙講台語，手寫台文。</div><div style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">-</div><div style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>孫翊倫Sun I̍k-lûn</b></span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">（高雄市立新莊高級中學）<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">/ 優等</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">時間，親像無sio送ê ǹg望，是溪水流--過，無聲無sueh；人生，親像免pué-huē ê一切，hōo人king體，mā bē歹勢。性命，kám m̄是tiānn-tiānn tī-leh跋倒koh再peh--起-來ê時tsūn，雖bóng有空喙，甚至流血流滴，不而過，堅phí ê號，ē-sái hōo lán tī人生ê路頂，行kah koh-khah在--leh？無論天頂ê星偌nī閃閃爍、月娘偌nī圓，lán tio̍h-ài ē-hiáu想，íng過hit个彎彎uat-uat ê家己，m̄-thang放bē記--得。</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">代先，ē-sái得著tsit擺ê優等，有影是真榮幸，mā感恩評審對我ê肯定。Tsit幾冬，開始接觸台語文創作，tsiah體會--著，lán若斟酌身軀邊ê每一層代誌，tsia-ê ta̍p-ta̍p滴滴，lóng ē tsiânn做創作ê啟示。落尾，台語若beh出頭天，招lín同齊來支持。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳冠樺Tân Kuàn-huâ</b></span>（臺北市立建國高級中學）/ 優等</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div><b>你是tá位仔人</b></div><div><b><br /></b></div></span></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">人攑頭望月，阮mā m̄甘頭lê-lê；過磅空，崙仔頂一tshok一tshok sio疊ê雲，uì窗仔內kā看bē輸山leh食薰。想著舊厝iáu有灶leh等阮tuínn食飯（puīnn），大腸就隨kā小腸報喜。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Kah故鄉ê親tsiânn厝邊無親，kah序大ê思想bē ha̍h，suah ē惜念土地ê溫情。一二十冬後ê阮phàng ē koh親像蘭陽溪，走揣海洋；待阮kā真正ê家己khioh倒tún--來，sì-kè thô-thô m̄管lak袋仔póo-póo，風中ê毛毛仔雨（muî-muî-á-hōo）lóng ē將阮牽sio倚。相信磅空ê水聲ē響tī阮ê心頭，一直到阮ku kah hām田水sio唚。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">語言kah文學lóng是寂寞--ê，m̄-koh話若koh講倒tún--來，tsit兩項mā是澈底屬於lán ê天地。想beh kā逐家koo-tsiânn：請m̄好放棄，台語文學絕對ē hōo lín自由。（Mā歡迎來宜蘭行行--leh！）</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>彭遵Phênn Tsun</b></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">（國立臺灣師範大學附屬高級中學）/ 佳作</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><br /></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">夜，接suà日--時，m̄-koh bē講是夜leh占地盤。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">暗西，lán講伊是「落山」。山ê邊界，變做是辭別日--時ê分界，一个終點。天光天暗，kánn-ná一改有頭有尾ê旅行。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">月娘--leh？人m̄ bat講伊是「落山」。無論是陰晴圓缺，月娘lóng ē tī暗時出現，當然有時tng頭白日mā有伊ê形影。月娘無像日頭hiah-nī hiánn目，kan-na有時攑頭ē看--見。無偌久以後，koh恬恬仔消失tī bâ霧仔光內，讓位hōo白日。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán對日頭ê辭別，是曠闊ê「落山」；對月娘ê辭別是恬恬無聲--ê，上濟講「月落」iah是「月斜西」，hōo月娘ke一分淡淡ê祕密。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tsiok歡喜第一改參加tsit種比賽就ē-sái tio̍h獎。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">因為我平常時tsiok kah意hip相，尤其是hip月娘，所以tsiah想著「月娘無 “落山” tsit種講法」，我家己tsiok kah意tsit種tuì生活內底出發ê哲學iah是語言觀察。Tsiok感謝評審有看著我ê作品。</span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>陳宜昇Tân Gî-sing</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">（臺中市立西苑高級中學）/ 佳作</span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">壁頂ê時鐘，秒針恬恬親像阮</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">窗仔口ê風，逐暗kā無字ê冊頁掀--起-來</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿媽用目屎煮一碗湯</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我用目睭leh揣--你——tī碗底、tī夢中</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">隔壁大門「kha̍h」一聲</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阮kā身軀khiû--起-來</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kā hit寡講bē了ê話　lóng鎖tī屜仔內底</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kah hit張退色ê紙　做伙生菇</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">你bat講</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">海，是自由ê比喻</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tann，我suah tī海湧聲中</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">聽著跤kê聲</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">啊！三更半暝</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Koh有人來挵門--ah</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tsit改</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">我m̄敢開</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Mā m̄敢m̄開</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Ē-tàng tio̍h獎，我真正tsiok歡喜。Tsiânn多謝李江却台語文教基金會hōo我tsit个舞台，用新詩傳達我對台語文kah民主自由ê愛。Mā ǹg望未來ē有愈來愈濟ê少年家，願意用台文創作逐項逐款ê主題，hōo台語文行向生活化。</span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>林詠禎Lîm Īng-tsing</b></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">（辭修高級中學）/ 佳作</span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><br /></div><div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">玻璃矸仔ê內底有té五彩紙星，是阮細漢áu--落ê夢kah心願。Hit-tsūn阮相信講，只要hē願，就ē-tàng來實現。到tann星iáu tī--leh，鬥陣áu星ê人suah已經走散--去。阮kā願望交hōo星，suah無發現，大漢了後ê家己，拄沓沓仔變做hit个閃爍ê天星，替曾經ê夢想實現。紙星，是lán相信--過ê溫柔kah美好。</span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><div><div>逐家好，我是林詠禎，目前是讀辭修高中二年仔。</div><div>Ē揀áu紙當做主題，是因為阮阿爸tsiok kah意áu紙，自細漢我就看著tsiok濟作品，我bat áu過紙星，感覺tsiok趣味mā tsiok有意義--ê。</div><div>最後--leh，多謝我ê爸母支持，感謝主辦單位hōo我ê多元學習koh ke一項。</div><div><br /></div></div></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</span></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>余宥潔Î Iū-kiat</b></span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">（臺北市立育成高級中學）<span style=\"font-family: arial;\">/ 佳作</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div><b>Tī市場ê hit段日子</b></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b><br /></b></div></span></div><div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tih、tih、tih！又koh是落雨ê一工，阮三姊妹仔靴管穿--leh，tsông tuì tī市場內ê阿公、阿媽in兜去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「阿公～我來kā你包麻粩！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「阿媽～我來huah賣！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「我mā beh，我mā beh！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">麻粩、寸棗、生仁、桔餅、糕仔……</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「來～看māi仔--ooh，麻粩、米粩一包50～」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">一人負責收錢，一人負責找錢，一人負責té人客買ê mi̍h件，生理是做kah tshiâng-tshiâng滾。Tsiânn實是——姊妹若仝心，烏塗變成金。</span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">Tsit篇短文寫--ê是我對細漢ê時tsiok深ê記持，阮兜細漢就真正tiānn-tiānn hām小妹做伙去阿公、阿媽in兜hia-ê菜市仔賣麻粩、寸棗koh一寡四秀仔，hit時是賣kah tsiok歡喜--ê！所以想講趁tsit个機會kā tsit段珍貴ê回憶記錄--落-來。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">非常感謝李江却台語文教基金會舉辦tsit个活動，因為是短短--à ê文章，hōo我leh寫ê時khah無文章長度ê壓力，koh有一个練習寫台文ê機會。最後mā beh感謝阿母一直堅持hām我講台語，支持我學台文，hōo我ē-sái用家己ê母語來寫作。</span></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\">-</div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></div><div><div><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><b>卓子翔Toh Tsú-siông</b></span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"><span>（文興高級中學）/ 佳作</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div><b>稻芳田中</b></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><b><br /></b></div></span></div><div><div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">天色iáu未光，風輕輕吹過田岸，稻仔芳芳，搖--啊搖。牛犁khap--過ê潤土，潤潤koh tâm-tâm，秧仔一tshok一tshok，插落水底，年頭就leh ǹg望好年冬。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">白翎鷥hiuh hiuh leh飛，水雞tī田中ng tàu弄花，阮阿公用āng聲hainn一段老調，巡田尾看kám有福壽螺咬秧仔。等稻仔熟ê時拄熱--人，阿爸提keh仔，跤手liú-lia̍h，逐刀逐刀割落稻仔，汗水流kah規頷，lóng是為著將來ē-tàng tī街仔磅出一包一包ê磅米芳。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">最後，阿爸kā我講：「飽穗ê稻仔，頭lê-lê」，愈有學問愈有才調ê人，ē hōo人愈尊敬。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div></div><div style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>感謝心得</b></div><div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">感謝tsit擺李江却台語文教基金會選著我ê短文，其實tsit改寫ê靈感是我高二ê「自主學習成果」，其中閱讀台灣文學小說、試用台語文創作，過程得著tsiok濟啟示--ê！Ē-tàng講tse是我自主學習上好ê干證！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj0oJzAm_wPgax06L5TdsRISbqscrm5YgIMSKIzZFDX_KKU1o4yvN3EIogzXvZWae7WSzEx4_yLfoOAOyV1Lek6fjIsMsGtF9Nw9xoH3_voCphga2FJM5BGRuBa3fGvqjA7zU8HqZs2bzsWvgap1HBAZdgS4wCGubSx4ZJ9fXP24kbzGBIQiSuLhiI8eSb-=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3778cd; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 378期，2025年9月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: left;\"></p></div></span></div></h2><h3 style=\"margin: 0px; position: relative; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></h3><h3 style=\"margin: 0px; position: relative;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration-line: none;\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration-line: none;\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div align=\"center\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\" style=\"color: #050505; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">#李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。  </span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div></div></span></div></h2></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></div>"
